 ; Select Upscaler for Dx12 games
-; xess, fsr21, fsr22, ffx (FSR 2.3; 3.1; 4.x), sgsr2, dlss
+; xess, fsr21, fsr22, ffx (FSR 2.3; 3.1; 4.x), sgsr2, asr (Arm ASR), dlss
