+; -------------------------------------------------------
+[ASR]
+; -------------------------------------------------------
+; Arm Accuracy Super Resolution (upscaler=asr / asr_12) shader preset.
+; Independent of the upscaling ratio: quality keeps FSR 2.2's image quality,
+; balanced and performance trade some of it for lower GPU cost.
+; quality, balanced or performance - Default (auto) is balanced
